     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">Hello there, </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">I&#39;m sorry if\r\nmy question is very basic, but I&#39;m kinda new to mirt models. I have an esem\r\nmodel with two correlated dimensions. My items are polytomous and I used mplus\r\nand the wlsmv estimator to run the model. <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">I was\r\nwondering if there is any way to transform item unstandardized loadings and\r\nthresholds to the mirt metric. <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">If my\r\nquestion is inappropriate or misplaced, I&#39;m sorry.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Here is the\r\nfirst item as an example:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">           </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">load 1<span style=\"border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">      </span>load\r\n2<span style=\"border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">   </span>thrs1<span style=\"border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">     </span>thrs2<span style=\"border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">     </span>thrs3<span style=\"border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">     </span>thrs4<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">item 1<span style=\"border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">   </span>0.863<span style=\"border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">    </span>-0.162<span style=\"border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">   </span>-1.991<span style=\"border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">   </span>-1.118<span style=\"border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">   </span>-0.033<span style=\"border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">   </span>1.318<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">I would be very thankful if\r\nanyone could point me some reference, if my question even makes sense.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Thanks in advance. <u></u><u></u></span></p></div>"
